### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@passwordResetToken = {{$dotenv PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN}}

### ===========================================
### Password Reset Flow
### ===========================================

### Request password reset email
# Always returns 200 (prevents email enumeration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "thenetimp@gmail.com"
}

### Reset password with token
# Get token from email/console logs after forgot-password
# Copy token to rests/.env: PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN=abc123...
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "{{passwordResetToken}}",
  "password": "NewSecurePass456789"
}

### ===========================================
### Change Password (Authenticated)
### ===========================================

### Change password (requires auth and current password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "SecurePass12345678",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePass456789"
}
